<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Canadian Occidental.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Canadian Occidental.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it initiated coverage of Canadian Occidental Petroleum Ltd as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said expects Canadian Occidental to post cash flow per share of C$6.70 in 1997 and C$7.30 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said expects the company to earn C$0.81 a share in 1997 and C$0.73 a share in 1998.</p>
</text>
